## 🟢 Tier 3: Differentiation Features (v0.2+)

These features make Axtrizen best-in-class and differentiate it from competitors.

### 8. Git Integration & Version Control

**Why it matters:** Devin creates PRs automatically. This is table-stakes for a development platform.

| Sub-Feature | Description | Effort |
|---|---|---|
| **Auto-Commit** | Agent code changes auto-committed to project git repo with descriptive messages | 3 pts |
| **Branch Management** | Each project/sprint gets its own branch. Manager merges when phase completes | 3 pts |
| **PR Creation** | Auto-create GitHub/GitLab PR from agent work with summary and file list | 5 pts |
| **Diff Viewer** | In-app diff viewer showing all changes made by agents | 3 pts |

---

### 9. Agent Memory & Context System

**Why it matters:** Manus has a knowledge module. The community has skills like `cognitive-memory`, `chromadb-memory`, and `cloud-memory`. Long-term memory makes agents dramatically better.

| Sub-Feature | Description | Effort |
|---|---|---|
| **Short-Term Memory** | Per-session working memory that persists within a project execution | 2 pts |
| **Long-Term Memory** | Cross-project learnings stored in vector DB (ChromaDB or similar) | 5 pts |
| **Shared Team Memory** | Team-level knowledge base that all agents can reference | 3 pts |
| **Memory Inspector** | UI to browse, search, and edit agent memories | 3 pts |

---

### 10. External Channel Integration

**Why it matters:** Real teams use Slack/Discord. Agents should be able to receive tasks and post updates there.

| Sub-Feature | Description | Effort |
|---|---|---|
| **Slack Integration** | Bot that receives commands and posts agent updates to Slack channels | 5 pts |
| **Discord Integration** | Same for Discord servers | 5 pts |
| **Webhook API** | Custom webhook endpoints for external tool integration | 3 pts |
| **Email Reports** | Scheduled email digests of project progress | 3 pts |

