### 11. CI/CD Pipeline Integration

**Why it matters:** Devin runs CI checks before submitting. Agents should trigger tests and deployments.

| Sub-Feature | Description | Effort |
|---|---|---|
| **Run Tests** | Agent triggers test suite and reads results | 3 pts |
| **Build Pipeline** | Trigger build process and report success/failure | 3 pts |
| **Deploy Preview** | Auto-deploy staging preview from agent-generated code (like Manus's `expose_port`) | 5 pts |
| **CI Status Board** | Dashboard showing build/test/deploy status per project | 3 pts |

