## 📋 Recommended Sprint Plan

| Sprint | Focus | Key Deliverables |
|---|---|---|
| **Sprint 1** (Current) | 🔴 SDLC Engine Core | Phase orchestration, plan generation, task assignment, human feedback gate |
| **Sprint 2** | 🔴 Board + File Extraction | Kanban/List board, code file extraction from agent responses, workspace file browser |
| **Sprint 3** | 🟡 Agent Communication | Structured message types, review protocol, agent role templates |
| **Sprint 4** | 🟡 Mission Control + Chat | Multi-agent monitoring, chat search, code block actions |
| **Sprint 5** | 🟢 Git + Memory | Auto-commit, branch management, short-term & long-term memory |
| **Sprint 6** | 🟢 Integrations | Slack/Discord, CI/CD pipeline, deploy preview |

